The native helper compiles the official InChI 1.07.3 kernel with the recorded
ReShiki string-stream repair in tools/inchi-helper/source-patches.json.
The repair reserves the terminating NUL, checks representable buffer sizes,
and passes identifier text as a string argument rather than a printf format.
The audited original source remains unchanged; compilation uses a private copy.
Source/header notices remain in that copy. The IUPAC,
InChI Trust and InChI Project MIT notices are retained in LICENSE.

